- public String fractionToDecimal(int numerator, int denominator)
- requires -2^31 <= numerator && numerator <= 2^31 - 1 && denominator != 0;
- ensures the result is a string representing the fraction in decimal format;
- ensures the length of the result string is less than 10^4;
- ensures if the fractional part is repeating, it is enclosed in parentheses;
- ensures if multiple answers are possible, any of them can be returned.